Automated Disk Sanitizer (Duplicate File Removal System)
Project Overview
Automated Disk Sanitizer is a Python automation project that scans a specified directory, identifies duplicate files using MD5 checksum hashing, safely removes duplicate copies, and generates a detailed log report. The project demonstrates concepts of Python File I/O, Automation, Scheduling, Directory Traversal, Hashing, Command Line Arguments, and System Utilities.
