Project Workflow
1.	Accept directory path from the command line.
2.	Validate the directory.
3.	Traverse all files using os.walk().
4.	Generate an MD5 checksum for each file.
5.	Store checksum and file path in a dictionary.
6.	Identify duplicate files.
7.	Delete duplicate copies while keeping one original.
8.	Calculate disk space saved.
9.	Generate a detailed log file.
10.	Repeat the process periodically using the Scheduler.
