Functions Used
CalculateChecksum(FileName)
Calculates the MD5 checksum of a file by reading it in binary mode.
Returns
•	MD5 hash value (Hexadecimal String)
________________________________________
FindDuplicate(DirectoryName)
Scans the directory recursively and identifies duplicate files based on checksum values.
Returns
•	Dictionary containing checksum as key
•	List of duplicate file paths as value
•	Total files scanned
________________________________________
DeleteDuplicate(DirectoryName)
Deletes duplicate files, calculates disk space saved, execution time, and generates the log file with below details:
•	Date                   : 28/07/2026
•	Time                   : 23:13:52
•	Total Files Scanned    : 3
•	Duplicate Files Found  : 3
•	Total Files Deleted    : 0
•	Disk Space Saved       : 0.00 MB
•	Execution Time         : 0.0 Seconds
